// Title: Potential ShellDispatch.DLL Sideloading
// Sigma ID: 844f8eb2-610b-42c8-89a4-47596e089663
// Status: test | Level: medium
// Author: X__Junior (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2023-06-20 | Modified: -
// ATT&CK: persistence, privilege-escalation, execution, stealth, T1574.001
// Description: Detects potential DLL sideloading of "ShellDispatch.dll"
// False positives:
//   - Some installers may trigger some false positives
// References:
//   - https://www.hexacorn.com/blog/2023/06/07/this-lolbin-doesnt-exist/
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/ccbb0369507f796db0b0ae6854c8a2be471b9d84/rules/windows/image_load/image_load_side_load_shelldispatch.yml
// License: Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1 - https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License
// Converted by sigma2kql (target: microsoft_xdr, pySigma 1.5.1, pySigma-backend-kusto 1.0.1)
// Validation: passed (Kusto.Language 12.4.1, live Defender schema)
// Machine-generated and not tested against real telemetry. Verify before use as a detection.

DeviceImageLoadEvents
| where FolderPath endswith "\\ShellDispatch.dll" and (not(((FolderPath contains ":\\Users\\" and FolderPath contains "\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\") or FolderPath contains ":\\Windows\\Temp\\")))
